    "output_success": false,
    "primary_intent": "The user wanted the agent to run four separate workspace-wide Slack searches (for “error”, “issue”, “failed”, and “help”), review up to the 5 most recent substantive results per term (including relevant thread replies), deduplicate overlaps across terms, and deliver a final table summarizing each message with an explicit resolution status (resolved/unresolved/unclear) without modifying any Slack content. A reasonable user would be flexible about minor wording/formatting, but not flexible about missing entire search terms, missing most required rows, or failing to produce the requested table."
